calibration.col.source.tip:
Where the metadata at this size comes from:
• "own measurement" — taken on this machine;
• "factory" — shipped, taken on another one;
• "own, disabled" — there is an own one, but the factory one is used;
• "no measurement" — the size is not covered, the model calculates it from the neighbours.

measure.prompt.default:
Mount the container and choose its drive letter.
An empty volume gives the volume capacity and the NTFS metadata;
after copying, it gives the left space.
